{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhulv-e-o056","title":"《吴志》记赤乌五年朱然征柤中，蒲忠不利胡质退","accounts":[{"id":"zhulv-a-c82beb752e9e1f89c2a3","label":"正文","text":"赤乌五年，然征柤中；魏将蒲忠、胡质各将数千人，忠要遮险隘图断然后，质为忠继援","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-8ef38ae58639a7628fc4","label":"正文","text":"时然所督兵将先四出，闻问不暇收合，便将帐下现兵八百人逆掩；忠战不利，质等皆退","evidence":["zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"征柤中者；以八百人逆掩者","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]},{"person":"zhulv-p0017","role":"要遮险隘者；战不利者","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0047","role":"为忠继援者；退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"多时段分列，不推年。","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","source_order":[56,88,0],"related_events":[{"event":"zhulv-e-o056-s2-1","type":"related","evidence":["zhulv-q-0401b7188a7b776f048a","zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]},{"event":"zhulv-e-o056-s2-1","type":"disputes","evidence":["zhulv-q-0401b7188a7b776f048a","zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"]}],"order":9977}],"persons":[{"id":"zhulv-p0017","name":"蒲忠","evidence":["zhulv-q-f70ae773f634852498ed","zhulv-q-fb5dc1c14b65381c4d72"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhulv-q-0401b7188a7b776f048a","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-3c7784d6ff3304e90fd2","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏（志）〔书〕》及《江表传》云，然以景初元年、正始二年再出为寇，所破胡质、蒲忠在景初元年。《魏志》承《魏书》，依违不说质等为然所破，而直云然退耳。《吴志》说赤乌五年，于魏为正始三年，魏将蒲忠与朱然战，忠不利，质等皆退。按《魏少帝纪》及《孙权传》，是岁并无事，当是陈寿误以吴嘉禾六年为赤乌五年耳","attribution":"裴注·孙氏异同评","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-